# =============================================
# API 网关拦截规则（Pipeline 示例）
# 演示如何用 pipeline:// 处理 API 格式转换
# =============================================
@name "API 网关联调"
@priority 100

# --- MITM 拦截域名 ---
@intercept gateway.example.com

# --- Hosts 映射 ---
192.168.1.100 gateway.example.com

# --- API 拦截（走 Pipeline 拆包/组包）---
# 匹配 API 网关格式的请求，通过 yunapi 适配器转换后转发到本地后端
/\/cgi\/api\?.*action=delegate/  pipeline://yunapi
/\/_api\/myapp\//  pipeline://yunapi  @cors

# --- 其他静态资源正常代理 ---
/\/static\//  http://127.0.0.1:3000/static/
